{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01CFrBiPUHaL9u4s7UoKEeiS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The nginx config has an issue - the `proxy_pass` directive is having trouble with the URL. This is because `${LEAVE_SERVICE_URL}` includes `http://` prefix, but the issue is that the entrypoint.sh needs to properly pass the default value to envsubst.\n\nLet me look at what's happening:\n- LEAVE_SERVICE_URL defaults to `http://localhost:8080`\n- envsubst replaces `${LEAVE_SERVICE_URL}` with `http://localhost:8080`\n- nginx then sees `proxy_pass http://localhost:8080/;` which should be valid\n\n\n- But the error says \"invalid URL prefix\" on line 14, which is the proxy_pass line\n\nThe real problem is that by only specifying `$LEAVE_SERVICE_URL` in the envsubst command, it's still substituting other variables like `$http_host` in the proxy_set_header directives, which breaks those lines since they need the literal `$` for nginx variables. Looking at line 14 where the proxy_pass directive is, after substitution it should resolve to `proxy_pass http://localhost:8080/;` which is valid syntax. I'm wondering if the issue might be with the JSON in the return statement—the curly braces could be causing nginx to misparse it. But actually, single quotes should protect that. Let me reconsider what happens when envsubst processes the template: if the LEAVE_SERVICE_URL variable isn't set in the container, the substitution might fail or leave the variable reference intact. Looking at the entrypoint script, I'm setting a default value and stripping trailing slashes, so that should handle it.\n\nWait—I just realized the real problem. The variable is being set in the shell but never exported, so envsubst won't see it. I need to export LEAVE_SERVICE_URL before calling envsubst. I need to export the `LEAVE_SERVICE_URL` variable in the entrypoint script so that `envsubst` can properly substitute it into the nginx configuration file instead of leaving it blank.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31328,"cache_read_input_tokens":11008,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":31328,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"74582627-f9b4-4bf2-823b-05bb42d3c266","uuid":"c64d67c3-ba14-4fe8-918c-60b68d4e5f58"}
